&s=c39bcb4e3e7ccb04762162bf9d51f73e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ff09fd21/uploads/origins/d2cc04a8-0cce-400e-a7d7-5689c719dea9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c39bcb4e3e7ccb04762162bf9d51f73e, https://si.imgix.net/ff09fd21/uploads/origins/d2cc04a8-0cce-400e-a7d7-5689c719dea9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d3e496603fef77cd76125216833e3d8e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ff09fd21/uploads/origins/d2cc04a8-0cce-400e-a7d7-5689c719dea9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2297b38f78ee7f94d994874c54fce233 3x"}, "body": "Hello sensei! I would love to request an illustration for 2 of my OCs.\n\n(1) Noah/190cm\n\nHe has a sleeve that is tied as if you hide the right arm (details shown in the concept image). He appears to have a cold personality, which stems from his traumatic experiences. \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1a1nL5ySjOQz8No02MrY9CQENIOIQ-VrA\n\n(2) Valora/165cm\n\nShe is an Onmyoji; she has a tomboyish and calm personality. You can draw her gap moe it's up to you.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1KCUl13z4351VvW40RLxgYxGRrel503Iv\n\nNoah is Valora's shikigami, they formed a pact (Noah's on his tounge, Valora's on her ring finger)\nThey hate each other quite a bit. Noah voluntarily become Valora's shikigami for his own good. \n\nI have no mood required for this request, either a romantic or a creepy vibe, both are OK with me!\n\nAs for other elements, such as compositions, poses, etc., I will leave it entirely up to you! \n\nThank you for your consideration!", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Akatamanegi_Ill/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/03b18cca/uploads/origins/c043ca7b-023a-46dd-98a0-805173bd8632?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=